  "notes": "Waiver Exhibit A (cash basis), period 10/1/21-9/30/22. Same choices as FY2023/FY2024: governmental = General, Street, Cemetery Park and Savings columns; business-type = Water and Sewer columns. Savings holds the water project / water maintenance / pump emergency investments (Schedule of Investments p3); its 10,051.00 is printed on the Water line (line 48) and recorded as a governmental line labelled Water. Beginning Savings 37,499.80 is printed on line 1 Net Cash Balance (line 2 Investments blank), so beginning_investments is null; ending Savings 48,651.24 is printed on line 27 Investments (ending_investments, informational, inside ending_cash). Transfers 21,151.00 (Total column lines 20 and 50) are both in the Savings column (Schedule of Interfund Transfers p3: Water Project to USDA 10,051.00, Checking to Pump Emergency 11,100.00); line 21/52 totals include them. Cemetery Park Fund 'Public Works - Other' recorded as health/welfare (cemetery) with review, as in FY2023. County treasurer balances 492.47 (10/1/21) and 223.05 (9/30/22) printed separately below Exhibit A, not in the fund balances. Outstanding USDA water debt 113,918.70 (p3) not on the cash statement. Read pages 1-3 of 3"
